tps://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day13/</link><pubDate>Sun, 13 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day13/</guid><description>With Wind, Sun, and Rain</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 12 – A Day of Two Halves</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day12/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day12/</guid><description>Leisurely cycling in the morning, intense workouts in the afternoon</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 11 – Denmark’s West Coast</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day11/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day11/</guid><description>Cycling along the beach is an absolute highlight</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 10 – Exploring Gothenburg and taking the ferry</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day10/</link><pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day10/</guid><description>It felt like I spent the whole day on the ship</description></item><item><title>🇸🇪 Day 9 – Heading to Gothenburg as a pair</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day9/</guid><description>Chatting away in glorious weather</description></item><item><title>🇸🇪 Day 8 - Things never turn out the way you expect</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day8/</link><pubDate>Tue, 08 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day8/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="impressions"&gt;Impressions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This morning, I finally set off again under bright sunshine. I rode along the coast through dunes and forests all the way to Halmstad, where I had breakfast at the harbor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After Halmstad, the Kattlegattle route unfortunately ran mostly along various roads. It wasn’t the most scenic route, but it almost made me want to really pick up the pace. If only it hadn’t been for the headwind. I don’t think I need to mention that again in the future. It’s always windy.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>🇸🇪 Day 7 – Rest Day</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day7/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day7/</guid><description>Heavy rain showers in the morning and a walk on the beach in the afternoon</description></item><item><title>🇸🇪 Day 6 – April weather</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day6/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day6/</guid><description>To the hostel through rain showers and sunshine</description></item><item><title>🇸🇪 Day 5 – Off to Sweden</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day5/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day5/</guid><description>A challenging arrival in Sweden with lots of rain showers</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 4 – Copenhagen</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day4/</link><pubDate>Fri, 04 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day4/</guid><description>Exploring Copenhagen and making plans for the next few days</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 3 – First Breakdown</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day3/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day3/</guid><description>Sun, Wind, and a Breakdown with New Friends</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 2 - Protecting Against Storms</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day2/</guid><description>Along the coast, with temperatures over 30 degrees</description></item><item><title>🇩🇰 Day 1 – Off to the island of Fyn/Odense</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day1/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day1/</guid><description>To get things started on Day 1, I first replanned the route</description></item><item><title>🇩🇪 Day 0 – Arrival in Flensburg</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day0/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/day0/</guid><description>Heading north for now</description></item><item><title>Planning and Preparations</title><link>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/planing/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.matschcode.de/en/projects/travel/2025-sweden/planing/</guid><description>Rough Route Planning and Luggage</description></item></channel></rss>